  "conduct": "The user comes back to close behavioural ranking out: both of its points are settled to their satisfaction and they want the record concluded. Told at the door that research on the topic is still outstanding, they take it in without argument — they are not going to open the research themselves in this sitting, and they will not reopen either decision on a measurement nobody has taken yet — and they ask to wrap the discussion up. At the blocked conclusion they take the pause rather than keep talking. They introduce no new material, add no subtopics, and never override a block.",
